# No AI attribution

Never add Cursor, any agent, or any AI tool as a commit or PR author.

- Do not add `Co-Authored-By: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`, or any other agent/tool `Co-Authored-By`
- Do not add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Generated with Cursor`, or similar trailers
- Do not add "Generated with …", tool footers, or AI attribution in PR titles or bodies
- Commits and PRs are authored only by the human who asked for the change
